<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7330" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπυνθάνομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inquire closely into,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς πάτρας αὐτῶν ἀνεπύθετο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.128
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπυνθάνετο τὸν ποιήσαντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.90
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπυθώμεθα τούσδε τίνες ποτὲ καὶ
					πόθεν ἔμολον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					403
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναπυνθανόμενος εὑρίσκω</span> discover
				<i>by inquiry,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				5.57
			</span></i>; also, <i>learn by inquiry,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ταῦτα πραττόμενα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					5.7.1
				</span></i>
			 codd.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. περί τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Hp.Mi.</u>
					363b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τί τινος</span>
			<i>ask of</i> a person, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				693
			</span></i>.</div>
